      "content": "i know i should talk to them but my doctor is super busy and i can't get an appt for like two weeks. i just wanted to know if it's actually dangerous or if it's just like normal jitters from the thyroid. like is it typical for them to clash or are you saying i'm in actual danger right now? i don't want to miss doses of my adhd meds if i don't have to.",
