    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i understand but i really need to function at work tomorrow and i can't focus if i miss my dose. like, if i just take a half dose of my adderall instead of the full one, would that be a safe way to handle it until my appointment? i just want to know if that's a reasonable middle ground so i don't run into any real issues.",
